==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*dobyťa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|добы́ча|ann=y}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-добыча.ogg}}
* {{ru-IPA|до́быча|ann=y}} {{q|used by mining industry workers but proscribed}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|добы́ча|dim=добы́чка}}

# [[extraction]], [[mining]], [[quarrying]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''добы́ча''' [[нефть|не́фти]]|oil production}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''добы́ча''' угля́|coal production}}
# [[booty]], [[spoil]], [[plunder]] {{gloss|plunder taken from an enemy in time of war, or seized by piracy}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[принести|принёс]] [[ценный|це́нную]] '''добы́чу'''.|He has brought some valuable '''booty'''.}}
# [[prey]], [[catch]] {{gloss|something which is captured or caught}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[стать]] '''добы́чей'''|to [[fall prey]] (to)}}

